From 2af2e948e4a64d0cf60f8cec8d6efe9f5ca7e6d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:55:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD terminal visual selection across both panes for
 Vim-style yanks

Command-mode v starts character selection immediately in the focused pane, keeps the anchor stable while right-pane history jumps move the cursor, and covers character, line, and block yanks through UI harness scenarios.
